// AREA isles: the Champion steps off the Isle Ferry at Sunport. Tamsin tells
// the story of the three beacons and the quest tree (islesBeacons) begins.

## The ferry quay

::bg{location="sunport-quay" time="day"}
::music{playback="change" mood="calm" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The Isle Ferry bumps against the Sunport quay. Three islands sit on the horizon, and on each one a tower that should be a beacon stands dark.
@sunportHarbormaster{code="0010"}: Champion! We heard. Everyone heard. Mind the ropes.
::actor{character="sunportSage" anchor="right" action="enter"}
@sunportSage{code="0010" emotion="worried"}: Three nights now, and not one beacon lit. The boats have stopped sailing after dark.
@sunportSage{code="0020"}: Men in grey coats came on the last ferry. They climbed the towers, and when they came down the great lenses were gone.

<branch id="islesArrivalAsk" prompt="What do you say?">
  <choice id="help" text="I'll get the lenses back">
    @sunportSage{code="0030" emotion="happy"}: I thought you might say that. Brand keeps Emberkey, Sorrel keeps Mistral, Nerissa keeps Coralreach. Bring each of them their lens.
  </choice>
  <choice id="who" text="Grey coats? Team Eclipse is gone">
    @sunportSage{code="0040"}: Gone from the mainland, maybe. What is left of them calls itself the Dusk Remnant now. Brand, Sorrel and Nerissa keep the beacons. Bring each of them their lens.
  </choice>
</branch>

::accept{quest="islesBeacons"}
@sunportSage{code="0050"}: And when all three burn, go down to the old shrine under the town. The beacons were built to light its door.
::actor{character="sunportSage" action="exit"}
